    "description": "14 cards: 6 commons, a common (a Special Guests card instead in 1.8% of boosters), 3 uncommons, a wildcard of any rarity (a common 12.5%, an uncommon 62.5%, a rare 10.6%, a Stellar Sights rare 10% or mythic rare 2.5%, a viewport land rare 1%, or a mythic rare, a mythic rare viewport land or a triumphant or surreal space card), a rare (80.4%) or mythic rare (14.2%) or a triumphant (rare 2%) or surreal space (rare 2%) card or a mythic rare viewport land, a traditional foil of any rarity (a common 58%, an uncommon 32%, a rare 6.4%, a mythic rare 1.1%, a Stellar Sights rare 1%, or a Stellar Sights mythic rare or a viewport, triumphant or surreal space card) and a land (a basic 64%, foil 16%; a borderless celestial basic 16%, foil 4%). Published only as less than 1%, so derived: within the triumphant and surreal space cards a mythic rare is half as likely as a rare (per card), so the rare slot's triumphant and surreal space mythic rares are 0.33% and 0.27% and its mythic rare viewport land the 0.79% left to 100%; the wildcard's 0.9% left to 100% is shared among its mythic rares, mythic rare viewport lands and triumphant and surreal space cards as in the rare slot (0.65%, 0.04%, 0.11% and 0.10%); the foil's Stellar Sights mythic rares are 0.25% (half a rare's per-card odds) and its viewport, triumphant and surreal space cards share the 1.25% left as in the Collector Booster's foil Booster Fun slot. Each booster also holds a double-sided token, which isn't a game card.",
